{"id":"a7893fab8d3271c2","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-comb9-rapid-ultrafilter.md","title":"ZFC Comb9 Rapid Ultrafilter","display":"df-zfc-comb9-rapid-ultrafilter — ZFC Comb9 Rapid Ultrafilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb9-rapid-ultrafilter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb9-rapid-ultrafilter"],"display":"df-zfc-comb9-rapid-ultrafilter — ZFC Comb9 Rapid Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb9-rapid-ultrafilter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb9-rapid-ultrafilter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb9-rapid-ultrafilter — ZFC Comb9 Rapid Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,f,A,e\\in V\">\\(U,f,A,e\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9RapidUltrafilter}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9RapidUltrafilter}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}rapid\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9RapidUltrafilter}_S(U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land \\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(\\{k\\}\\notin U)\\land \\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in U\\;\\exists e\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(e,\\omega,A)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(e)=A\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m&lt;n\\to e(m)&lt;e(n))\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to f(n)&lt;e(n))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}rapid\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9RapidUltrafilter}_S(U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land \\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(\\{k\\}\\notin U)\\land \\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in U\\;\\exists e\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(e,\\omega,A)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(e)=A\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m&lt;n\\to e(m)&lt;e(n))\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to f(n)&lt;e(n))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ultrafilter predicate now matches <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>, and the increasing enumeration is a typed function graph rather than an arrow metavariable.</li>\n<li>Nonprincipality is expressed by excluding all singleton generators; rapidity is eventual domination by the increasing enumeration of some member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[58-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The ultrafilter predicate now matches [[58-df-ultrafilter]], and the increasing enumeration is a typed function graph rather than an arrow metavariable.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"U,f,A,e\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9RapidUltrafilter}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}rapid\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9RapidUltrafilter}_S(U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land \\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(\\{k\\}\\notin U)\\land \\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in U\\;\\exists e\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(e,\\omega,A)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(e)=A\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m<n\\to e(m)<e(n))\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to f(n)<e(n))\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":1477,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1737","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-comb9-rapid-ultrafilter.md|58-df-zfc-comb9-rapid-ultrafilter]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","36d7463d215be751","5045d216c83e75cb"]}